      "message": "Fix typed C migration callers and synchronize task I/O qualification observations\n\nDeclare exact 64-bit C caller prototypes for both migrated LLVM paths and reject undeclared or non-prototype calls. Add actual high-bit positive and missing-prototype negative controls, and reject weakened link receipts.\n\nSynchronize wake-FD observations with the documented final-canceller reference lifetime while retaining immediate user-FD checks, every planned case/repetition, deterministic rejection of the old observation, and all wrong-runtime controls. Compiler/runtime code and every performance protocol remain unchanged.",
